<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 60, left: 60, width: '1160px', height: '64px', background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 24px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>关键技术三：预取机制与响应性能</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F5' }}>04 · Performance</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 148, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ width: '420px', padding: '20px 24px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>未命中预取</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B97A8' }}>1120</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8B97A8' }}>ms</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>学生说完后再开始生成下一句</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '60px', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>→</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '420px', padding: '20px 24px', background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>命中预取</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>6</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>ms</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230' }}>说话期间已准备好，说完即出</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '196px', padding: '18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>提升幅度</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>187×</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>对话不再出现可感知停顿</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: '566px', padding: '16px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>预取怎么做</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          1. 学生开口的同时，前端把当前已识别文本投递给服务端
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          2. 服务端并发生成「下一步可能要说的话」并缓存
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
          3. 以答案前 60 字作为签名；提交时签名一致则直接复用，不一致则重新生成
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: '566px', padding: '16px 18px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>其他性能措施</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>· 检索增强用 BM25 而非向量模型：毫秒级响应，且不引入模型依赖</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>· 评估官与陪练官并行执行，报告生成 8~15 秒（目标 ≤ 30 秒）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>· 提示词输入长度截断，避免超窗导致的失败重试</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 18px', background: '#E8EFF8' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>为什么重要：</span>
        面试是实时对话场景，超过 1 秒的停顿就会破坏「像真人」的体验。预取把串行等待变成并行准备，是真实感的关键一环。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: '1160px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>面镜 MockMirror · AI 模拟面试与能力提升软件</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>13 / 20</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
